<title>UK: Johnson Matthey rally further.</title>
<headline>Johnson Matthey rally further.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Johnson Matthey Plc continued to soar on Friday mainly on a stock shortage in the British metals and machinery group.</p>
<p>By 0745 GMT the stock was up 29p to 552p.</p>
<p>The Financial Times newspaper said on Friday market makers would be short in Johnson Matthey which would fuel the surge.</p>
<p>&quot;The bounce is more a reflection that it was more oversold than anything else&quot;, one analyst said.</p>
</text>
